const USAGE=`The professor suggested that he ___ the experiment again.|repeat|repeats|repeated|would repeat|suggest that S (should) + 動詞の原形（仮定法現在）。
I'm looking forward to ___ from you.|hearing|hear|be heard|have heard|look forward to の to は前置詞。後ろは動名詞。
She is used to ___ up early.|getting|get|got|be getting|be used to doing「～に慣れている」。used to do「昔は～した」と区別。
The news made everyone ___.|excited|exciting|excite|to excite|人が「興奮させられる」ので過去分詞 excited。
He objected ___ treated like a child.|to being|to be|being|for being|object to doing。to は前置詞。
I can't afford ___ a new car.|to buy|buying|buy|bought|afford は to 不定詞を目的語にとる。
Would you mind ___ the window?|opening|to open|open|opened|mind は動名詞を目的語にとる。
She avoided ___ the question.|answering|to answer|answer|answered|avoid は動名詞を目的語にとる。
He stopped ___ when the teacher came in.|talking|to talk|talk|talked|stop doing「～するのをやめる」。stop to do は「～するために立ち止まる」。
Remember ___ the door when you leave.|to lock|locking|lock|locked|remember to do「忘れずに～する」（これからのこと）。remember doing は「～したことを覚えている」。
The doctor advised him ___ smoking.|to stop|stop|stopping|stopped|advise O to do。
My parents let me ___ abroad.|study|to study|studying|studied|使役 let O + 原形。
I had my hair ___ yesterday.|cut|to cut|cutting|cuts|have O + 過去分詞「Oを～してもらう」。
She made her son ___ his room.|clean|to clean|cleaning|cleaned|使役 make O + 原形。
He was made ___ for an hour.|to wait|wait|waiting|waited|使役 make の受動態では to 不定詞になる。
The book is worth ___.|reading|to read|read|being read|be worth doing「～する価値がある」。
Please ___ me your name.|tell|say|speak|talk|tell O O。say / speak / talk は人を直接目的語にとれない。
We discussed ___ for two hours.|the problem|about the problem|on the problem|for the problem|discuss は他動詞。about は不要。
She married ___ last year.|a doctor|with a doctor|to a doctor|for a doctor|marry は他動詞。be married to なら to が必要。
He ___ me of my father.|reminds|remembers|recalls|memorizes|remind A of B「AにBを思い出させる」。
They robbed him ___ his wallet.|of|from|for|with|rob A of B。steal B from A と区別。
I prefer coffee ___ tea.|to|than|from|over than|prefer A to B。
The heavy rain prevented us ___ going out.|from|to|of|for|prevent O from doing。
She succeeded ___ the exam.|in passing|to pass|passing|at pass|succeed in doing。
He insisted ___ paying the bill.|on|to|for|in|insist on doing。
The room was ___ small for ten people.|too|so|such|very much|too + 形容詞 + for ～「～には…すぎる」。
It was ___ a difficult question that nobody could answer it.|such|so|too|very|such a + 形 + 名 + that。so なら so difficult a question の語順。
___ of the students has a textbook.|Each|Every|All|Both|each of + 複数名詞は単数扱い。every は of を直接とれない。
He has ___ friends in this town, so he feels lonely.|few|a few|little|a little|可算名詞で「ほとんどない」は few。
There is ___ information about the topic.|little|few|many|a few|information は不可算名詞。
The number of applicants ___ increasing.|is|are|were|have been|the number of ～ は単数扱い。a number of ～ は複数扱い。
She is senior ___ me by three years.|to|than|from|of|senior / junior / superior / inferior は than ではなく to。
I'd rather ___ at home tonight.|stay|to stay|staying|stayed|would rather + 原形。
You had better ___ late again.|not be|not to be|don't be|not being|had better not + 原形。
It is no use ___ over spilt milk.|crying|to cry|cry|cried|It is no use doing「～しても無駄だ」。
He is said ___ rich when he was young.|to have been|to be|being|having been|述語動詞より前の時を表すときは完了不定詞。
The plan needs ___.|revising|to revise|revise|being revised|need doing = need to be done「～される必要がある」。
I regret ___ you that your application was rejected.|to inform|informing|inform|informed|regret to do「残念ながら～する」。regret doing は「～したことを後悔する」。
She ___ on the sofa and fell asleep.|lay|laid|lied|lain|自動詞 lie-lay-lain「横たわる」。laid は他動詞 lay の過去形。
Prices have ___ sharply this year.|risen|raised|rose|arisen|自動詞 rise-rose-risen「上がる」。raise は他動詞。`;
const STRUCT=`___ the first transcontinental railroad was completed in 1869 is well known.|That|What|It|Because|名詞節 That S V 全体が主語になっている。
Not until the nineteenth century ___ widely used.|did photography become|photography became|became photography|photography did become|否定語句 Not until ～ が文頭に出ると主節は倒置。
The Mississippi River, ___ flows into the Gulf of Mexico, is one of the longest rivers in North America.|which|that|it|where|カンマのある非制限用法では that は使えない。
___ a mammal, the whale breathes air.|Being|It is|Because|To being|分詞構文（= Because it is a mammal）。
Mercury is the planet ___ to the Sun.|closest|the closer|most close|closer than|名詞を後ろから修飾する最上級。
Only after the rain stopped ___ the game.|did they resume|they resumed|resumed they|they did resume|Only + 副詞節が文頭に出ると主節は倒置。
The more carefully you read, ___ you will understand.|the more|more|the most|much more|the + 比較級, the + 比較級「～すればするほど…」。
___ hard he tried, he could not solve the problem.|However|Whatever|No matter|Although|However + 形容詞/副詞 + S V。No matter は how が必要。
The committee demanded that the report ___ by Friday.|be submitted|is submitted|was submitted|submits|要求・提案の動詞 + that 節は動詞の原形（仮定法現在）。
Had I known about the meeting, I ___ it.|would have attended|would attend|attended|had attended|If の省略による倒置（仮定法過去完了）。
___ is known about the early life of the author.|Little|Few|A few|Many|動詞が単数 is。不可算扱いの Little「ほとんど～ない」。
Bats are the only mammals ___ truly fly.|that can|can|they can|which they|関係代名詞 + 動詞が必要。the only の後は that が好まれる。
Rarely ___ such a severe winter.|has the region experienced|the region has experienced|the region experienced|experienced the region|否定の副詞 Rarely が文頭に出ると倒置。
The Great Lakes contain about one-fifth of the world's fresh water, ___ them an important resource.|making|make|made|which make|結果を表す分詞構文。which を使うなら makes。
Jupiter is ___ planet in the solar system.|the largest|largest|the larger|most large|形容詞の最上級には the をつける。
___ their small size, hummingbirds can fly long distances.|Despite|Although|Even|In spite|前置詞 Despite + 名詞。In spite は of が必要、Although は節をとる。
Neither the students nor the teacher ___ aware of the change.|was|were|are|have been|neither A nor B は B に動詞を一致させる。
It was in 1969 ___ humans first landed on the Moon.|that|when did|which|then|強調構文 It is ... that ～。
The building, ___ in 1890, is now a museum.|constructed|was constructed|constructing|which constructed|過去分詞による後置修飾（which was constructed の省略）。
Scientists are still uncertain ___ the disease spreads.|about how|how about|that how|what|前置詞 about + 疑問詞節。
Sound travels faster through water ___ through air.|than|as|that|then|比較級 faster ... than。
The new bridge is twice ___ the old one.|as long as|longer as|as longer than|long than|倍数表現 + as + 原級 + as。
___, the experiment was a failure.|Strictly speaking|Strict speaking|To speak strict|Spoken strictly|慣用的な分詞構文 strictly speaking「厳密に言えば」。
Not only ___ the piano, but she also composes music.|does she play|she plays|plays she|she does play|Not only が文頭に出ると倒置。
The city ___ I was born has changed a lot.|where|which|that|what|関係副詞 where（= in which）。`;
// {}が下線部(A〜D)。文|正解番号(1-4)|解説
const WRITTEN=`{The amount} of tourists {visiting} the park {has increased} {steadily} since 2010.|1|可算名詞 tourists には The number を使う。
Each of the {students} {have} {his or her} own {locker}.|2|Each は単数扱い → has。
The scientist {which} {discovered} the new element {was awarded} {a prize}.|1|先行詞が人 → who。
She {has lived} in Boston {since} five years {and} knows the city {well}.|2|期間を表すときは for。
The lecture was {so} {bored} that many students {fell} {asleep}.|2|物が主語で「退屈させる」→ boring。
{Despite of} the bad weather, the {outdoor} concert {was held} {as scheduled}.|1|Despite に of は不要（または In spite of）。
Much of the {furnitures} in the museum {dates} from the {eighteenth} {century}.|1|furniture は不可算名詞。複数形にしない。
Dolphins are {known} for {its} intelligence {and} playful {behavior}.|2|Dolphins は複数 → their。
The professor {asked} the students {to read} the chapter {careful} before {the exam}.|3|動詞 read を修飾 → 副詞 carefully。
{Not only} the cost {but also} the time {required} {make} the project difficult.|4|not only A but also B は B (the time) に一致 → makes。
The river is {too} {pollute} for fish {to live} {in}.|2|形容詞が必要 → polluted。
{During} he was {studying} abroad, he {learned} to speak {three} languages.|1|節 (S V) の前は接続詞 While。
The new method is {more} {efficient}, cheaper, and {more easy} {to use} than the old one.|3|easy の比較級は easier。
Water {consists} {of} hydrogen and oxygen, {that} are both {gases} at room temperature.|3|非制限用法では which。
He {enjoys} {swimming}, hiking, and {to ride} {a bicycle}.|3|並列構造 → 動名詞 riding。
The {earliest} {known} maps {was drawn} on clay {tablets}.|3|主語 maps は複数 → were drawn。
{Because} the heavy snow, all {flights} {were} {canceled}.|1|名詞の前は Because of。
Since 1950, the company {has} {produce} {more than} a million {cars}.|2|has + 過去分詞 → produced。
{A} honest answer {is} {always} better {than} a clever lie.|1|honest は母音の発音で始まる → An。
The children {were} {exciting} {about} the trip {to the zoo}.|2|人が主語で「わくわくしている」→ excited。
Mount Everest is {higher} {than} {any other} {mountains} in the world.|4|any other + 単数名詞 → mountain。
{Neither} the manager {or} the employees {were} informed {of} the decision.|2|neither A nor B。
The {discover} of penicillin {changed} the {course} of {medicine}.|1|名詞が必要 → discovery。
Plants need sunlight {in order} {grow}, {which} is why they {bend} toward light.|2|in order to grow。to が必要。
She {suggested} {to go} to the library {to finish} {the assignment}.|2|suggest は動名詞をとる → going。`;
const L=s=>s.split('\n');
const D=window.EIGO_DATA;
D.decks.push(
 {id:'tw',type:'vocab',title:'TOEFL 英単語',sub:'アカデミック語彙＋同義語',items:L(WORDS).map(l=>{const [w,pos,m,syn]=l.split('|');return {k:'t:'+w,w,pos,m,syn}})},
 {id:'ti',type:'vocab',title:'イディオム',sub:'句動詞・慣用表現',stage:30,items:L(IDIOMS).map(l=>{const [w,m,ex]=l.split('|');return {k:'i:'+w,w,pos:'熟',m,ex}})},
 {id:'tu',type:'mc',title:'語法',sub:'動詞の語法・前置詞・数量詞',items:L(USAGE).map((l,i)=>{const a=l.split('|');return {k:'u:'+i,q:a[0],c:a.slice(1,5),e:a[5]}})},
 {id:'ts',type:'mc',title:'文法 Structure',sub:'空所補充（Section 2 前半形式）',items:L(STRUCT).map((l,i)=>{const a=l.split('|');return {k:'s:'+i,q:a[0],c:a.slice(1,5),e:a[5]}})},
 {id:'te',type:'err',title:'文法 Written Expression',sub:'誤り指摘（Section 2 後半形式）',items:L(WRITTEN).map((l,i)=>{const a=l.split('|');return {k:'e:'+i,s:a[0],a:+a[1]-1,e:a[2]}})}
);
D.groups=[
 {title:'英単語フラッシュカード',ids:['juken']},
 {title:'TOEFL ITP 対策',ids:['tw','ti','tu','ts','te']}
];
